[{"title":"赠郴阳何都宪子元巡抚云南 其二 述职方事","author":"邵宝","text":"疆圉萧条轸帝心，职方使者奉纶音。\n西关不杖张骞节，北野真赍郭隗金。\n秋水骅骝千里近，春风苜蓿四郊深。\n燕云一望连秦树，剩许山川入壮吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47491,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠郴阳何都宪子元巡抚云南 其三 述河南参政事","author":"邵宝","text":"朝有程书野有歌，行过颍水复黄河。\n天于斗极瞻时近，风自棠阴憩处多。\n七郡图经随我在，百年田里谓民何。\n寻常莫拟题名处，万仞嵩高石可磨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47492,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠郴阳何都宪子元巡抚云南 其四 述太仆少卿事","author":"邵宝","text":"马卿持节甸西东，騋牝长鸣起朔风。\n冀北群应逢伯乐，鲁坰才不颂僖公。\n六师气溢腾骧外，万国灵扬驾驭中。\n老骥绝尘吾望在，肯容毛仲并论功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47493,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追悼留鹤潘先生","author":"邵宝","text":"台海冥冥鹤不留，漫从诗卷见箕裘。\n百年星聚金陵会，六郡风生岱岳游。\n濠水游鱼心独契，苏门遗草手曾收。\n荒邱岁月休重问，年少王郎已白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47494,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋斋为周侍御宣题","author":"邵宝","text":"炎蒸历尽见清凉，扫地焚香爱此堂。\n苔径斑斑经雨碧，梧庭落落受霜黄。\n西南来处占风信，三五盈时看月光。\n更有北扉堪一眺，晚峰如玉正苍苍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47495,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盗窃陈氏忠孝录稿吊其诸孙嘉猷","author":"邵宝","text":"孤忠千载剩徽音，家乘而今竟陆沉。\n片纸不遗胠箧手，数行空负盖棺心。\n斯人自信怀无璧，何地犹疑购有金。\n四十年来方再读，为君惆怅古城阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47496,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"文山为程达赋","author":"邵宝","text":"两厓中有一峰悬，孤凤衔书下九天。\n万古文章真显设，百年风气正回旋。\n晋唐第宅瞻依外，吴越江山指点前。\n倾盖惠泉谈未了，晋陵回首思悠然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47497,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与徐秋官用中登松风阁先一年约登未果至是乃遂","author":"邵宝","text":"七里青山两载心，秋官为我一登临。\n病馀幽思泉兼石，别后佳音玉更金。\n夜雨不嫌苔径湿，春寒偏爱竹房深。\n松风阁上君曾坐，试问何如听颖琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47498,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中遇莫如山","author":"邵宝","text":"新春起我山中游，何处南沙亦小舟。\n偶出总缘风日好，相逢且值竹松幽。\n故人诗在僧能诵，别院茶来客又留。\n莫道匆匆难尽兴，稍须烟景再登楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47499,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月二日避客山中遇雪","author":"邵宝","text":"绮塍得雪净无尘，指点蓉湖别有津。\n北墅愿为西道久，青山争爱白头新。\n出城避客事非急，入寺逢僧意却真。\n梅花折来放且未，东风吹手正频频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47500,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕过吴永年茗坐其孙某侍而弹琴","author":"邵宝","text":"元宵处处笙歌酒，此处茶杯且听琴。\n白发主人应有兴，青天明月亦何心。\n糗餈似斗春盘巧，灯烛浑忘夜漏深。\n只尺桂岩成契阔，误将南市认山阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47501,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慈溪陈隐君七十","author":"邵宝","text":"祭酒声名海内传，百年门第故多贤。\n要知乡里歌椿日，正值郎君折桂年。\n月窟秋连沧海道，洞庭春载越江船。\n古稀正是期颐地，不用重吟杜老篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47502,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻孔道士讣","author":"邵宝","text":"梅鹤亭前始识君，吹笙几度坐斜曛。\n身栖野庙两经火，梦入仙坛一驾云。\n石室秋风閒剑履，板桥春草近祠坟。\n尊中有酒休重写，酹向荒邱恐不闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47503,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻母舅南湖公讣","author":"邵宝","text":"故林萧瑟正堪悲，一老而今又不遗。\n戚里坟高空石马，仙家路僻漫云芝。\n音传渭北鸿何远，魂返辽东鹤正迟。\n五十年前吾稚子，曾将论语照青藜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47504,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋海棠","author":"邵宝","text":"名姝魂返蜀天涯，犹有馀姿在此花。\n开处每依庭下石，移来非自海中槎。\n清含晓露如承雨，淡对秋风更着霞。\n检尽图经无族谱，独将色相借春誇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47505,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日过水北山庄","author":"邵宝","text":"草亭长为故人开，今雨无端长绿苔。\n新刻碑从人打去，旧披图许我题来。\n僧家磬落西峰日，贾客帆回北道埃。\n明日期君尽清兴，二泉亭上有茶杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47506,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水北山庄观菊","author":"邵宝","text":"天留佳色与黄华，每到秋风一拜嘉。\n栗里地能容醉老，南阳潭竟属仙家。\n题应有兴心偏苦，插岂无情鬓已华。\n记取馀香如送客，萧萧风径绕篱斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47507,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"知微斋席","author":"邵宝","text":"步自城西又向西，风吹草径已无泥。\n群分鸥鹭田田水，丛露菰蒲处处堤。\n何物老僧犹走乞，几家饥孺不号啼。\n山斋寂寞南沙夜，壶酒应须我一提。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47508,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题孙司徒寿砚堂","author":"邵宝","text":"远向端溪水上分，中书秃尽始知君。\n寻常四友休同论，千二百年何足云。\n池入海涛还浸月，岛回春吹欲生云。\n世家争羡文华国，更许何人策上勋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47509,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九我堂","author":"邵宝","text":"旧家门巷草堂深，九我名题万古心。\n岂是尚书犹缺望，祗应小雅有遗音。\n乾坤自许心丹在，夙夜焉知鬓雪侵。\n最恨庭闱宛如故，一回登降一沾襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47510,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与如山诸友避暑山中","author":"邵宝","text":"閒行五六七人同，竹林日影松坛风。\n客言此会舞雩下，僧歌我词盘谷中。\n茗盌及泉元有味，竹垆当暑却无功。\n冯谁传语知微子，秋夜山房好作东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47511,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登锡山退饮惠山方丈示同游诸君子","author":"邵宝","text":"独觉登山病后难，山中气象笔曾干。\n镜光初动春湖绿，塔影犹含夜雨寒。\n流水暗生禅榻听，飞花轻上舞衣看。\n兴馀更问西庵路，三里青松一径宽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47512,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观水北山人新作我行窝","author":"邵宝","text":"三里青山接水云，菊花时节每寻君。\n也知僻地真须假，敢谓虚名可与闻。\n閒处渔樵如宿约，老来农圃亦徒云。\n惟应再结吟诗社，共对西神赋夕曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47513,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中答友人","author":"邵宝","text":"腊残犹未探梅花，坐爱风庭雪片斜。\n粉米有形真入绣，玉田无种亦生芽。\n妆成山岳添奇观，涂破藩篱见大家。\n兴比剡溪还不浅，西郊吾欲驾吾车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47514,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南麓为宜兴徐仲和赋","author":"邵宝","text":"铜官盘据荆溪上，百里相看未了青。\n山麓平时堪别墅，水涯回处更幽亭。\n奇观爱入仙翁洞，隐迹愁干处士星。\n我识主人因静老，题诗遥贺草堂灵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47515,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得湛司成书","author":"邵宝","text":"甘泉一劄自金陵，我正题诗寄两僧。\n诗到白沙难着语，海天亭上望南鹏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47516,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘介夫 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"瘗卷邱边秋草多，两知亭下客频过。\n故人三宿还辞去，独听沧浪奈水何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47517,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘介夫 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"炎荒蜀道宦途长，何处风光不饱尝。\n鹿洞旧游时入梦，烦君为我赋新堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47518,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠冯廷伯","author":"邵宝","text":"看竹何须问主人，主人读易已忘春。\n一声啼鸟山居静，境似桃源不避秦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47519,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄山寺读书诸友","author":"邵宝","text":"锡山南下旧僧居，贤者今来借读书。\n门钥自收桥板断，要教游客笑人迂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47520,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"南湖秋接洞庭波，湖上閒人草结窝。\n白昼清风足幽梦，月明时复和渔歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47521,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"待月东冈十载前，曾教短许和诗篇。\n而今旧话休重论，自倚秋光对海天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47522,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其三","author":"邵宝","text":"蓝水飞流界玉峰，风声寒落隔溪松。\n道人细味悲秋句，日落空江闻远钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47523,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题王元章梅卷","author":"邵宝","text":"五陵豪客梅华笔，写尽江南万古春。\n莫向寻常乞题品，赤城山下有诗人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47524,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄天台友人","author":"邵宝","text":"天台峰下杖从容，曾是江东五马公。\n若问儿童歌舞地，敬亭山色画图中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47525,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻周用仁言襄甫作诗遣疟诗以问之谓东庐","author":"邵宝","text":"古闻诗句曾驱疟，石老今誇笔有神。\n莫道幽明非一理，若能惊鬼定惊人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47526,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"借观楷木杖于成汝从诗以还之","author":"邵宝","text":"楷木天然理最端，孔林千古挺高寒。\n谁将规作扶衰杖，合与周模一样看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47527,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月中对菊口占二绝 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"雨中曾向东邻看，月下南邻又送来。\n数本秋花千古兴，一尊须为故人开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47528,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月中对菊口占二绝 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"南邻索菊东邻送，只欠江州酒榼来。\n数月苦心三日赏，一般清艳两家开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47529,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为俞实斋题画","author":"邵宝","text":"履斋画里实斋堂，四十馀年故意长。\n我识渭阳情更切，西风岸藻不胜黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47530,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢赵良伯送竹 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"种竹无时亦漫谈，厌乾恶湿竟谁堪。\n贞元两字生生本，何事山人不解参。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47531,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢赵良伯送竹 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"三十八竿真碧玉，湘妃泪点尚斑斑。\n冉泾东畔书台上，行见千年老凤还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47532,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答如山","author":"邵宝","text":"南沙亭上有书来，安得新晴月满台。\n赋罢豳诗对风雨，江天漠漠鸟双回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47533,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"志喜答文玉用前韵","author":"邵宝","text":"彭蠡波平阳鸟来，滕王依旧水中台。\n虔州兵速神旗复，安庆城坚贼舰回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47534,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"文玉见月用前韵复之 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"雨声初静月光来，知有高人独上台。\n我亦梦游天柱顶，长歌风动綵云回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47535,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"文玉见月用前韵复之 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"桂花岩下月初来，上尽层楼复上台。\n塔畔烟收星错落，城边露下水萦回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47536,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忽闻点易台泉出","author":"邵宝","text":"点易朱闻滴露研，忽传此地有原泉。\n莫言一滴无多水，点尽乾坤是尽年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47537,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"试曲水","author":"邵宝","text":"正月已尽二月来，梅花半落杏初开。\n山中新作兰亭水，明日同人试一杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47538,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王中书画菊","author":"邵宝","text":"石庵画竹妙古今，菊也亦复钩其深。\n相逢莫认花颜面，同是岁寒君子心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47539,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新泉杂诗 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"瘗卷碑边泉水生，一泓环绕似多情。\n文章本是乾坤秀，光上星辰润下行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47540,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新泉杂诗 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"久旱惊看此地泉，涓涓未便到山田。\n野人不作为霖梦，为语邻僧莫浪传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47541,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新泉杂诗 其三","author":"邵宝","text":"山人爱泉泉出山，泠泠声在白云间。\n有情无情不须问，泉与山人心共閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47542,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新泉杂诗 其四","author":"邵宝","text":"清看滴滴松梢露，静爱源源石罅泉。\n滴滴休誇天上水，源源须识地中天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47543,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新泉杂诗 其五","author":"邵宝","text":"上方得石石如台，下界泉从石窦来。\n欲向中间斜作磴，磴边松树任僧栽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47544,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新泉杂诗 其六","author":"邵宝","text":"滴露泉边听玉声，万峰无籁昼琤琤。\n报时不用莲花漏，一息中涵万古情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47545,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日山中听泉","author":"邵宝","text":"石缝汩汩池泠泠，下池声似上池听。\n天一生生今若此，八峰云雾一峰青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47546,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陆全卿夜过锡代东 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"公曾寄我惠山诗，谓我忧时论自奇。\n欲向归舟更披写，五更寒卧不闻知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47547,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陆全卿夜过锡代东 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"回首羊肠谢险途，归来还自旧陈湖。\n他年故有寻僧兴，何处青山酒一壶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47548,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王中书为祖上人写翻经图松庵僧请题志感","author":"邵宝","text":"谁识翻经祖上人，中书画里见来真。\n当时客有先公在，不见风仪独怆神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47549,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为冯廷伯题画 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"八极周流皆我神，世间争爱梦中春。\n凭君莫向痴人说，谁信无身是有身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47550,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为冯廷伯题画 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"茫茫碧海上无天，何处乘槎不是仙。\n回首汉廷千载矣，令人却忆问津年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47551,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢王郡公送鹿","author":"邵宝","text":"书院初成路亦开，呦呦鹿自郡堂来。\n廿年却醒庐山梦，春草还生点易台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47552,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月岩","author":"邵宝","text":"岩岩千仞江边石，海月高时影在波。\n有客吹箫非赤壁，主人高兴夜如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47553,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读冯廷伯元始剩语三绝 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"会当子午全无象，子到中间一点生。\n从此乾坤还日月，此天先后自分明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47554,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读冯廷伯元始剩语三绝 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"太极生人人会谈，但能知二不知三。\n谁将拈出三中一，还与濂溪老子参。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47555,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读冯廷伯元始剩语三绝 其三","author":"邵宝","text":"才怪多言言已多，风来水面便生波。\n不如跳出樊笼去，独和尧夫击壤歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47556,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴蜀胜游","author":"邵宝","text":"西入岷嶓东到海，长江万里似银河。\n凭谁为问乘槎客，天上人间乐柰何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47557,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"种兰谢赵宜兴","author":"邵宝","text":"九畹滋兰自楚人，草荒茅塞几千春。\n而今乞得山中种，老眼看来种种真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47558,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和丁仁夫梦中忆涣然亭","author":"邵宝","text":"三子从容侍一亭，夜深灯火共谈经。\n因君却愧蒿庵意，曾许春风点瑟声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47559,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜鹊图","author":"邵宝","text":"他年屡为占慈母，母亦屡占游子归。\n今日中庭无一事，閒看风色亦依稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47560,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谖草图","author":"邵宝","text":"百年日短子心长，我为谖花爱此觞。\n今日东湖图画里，綵衣春酒庆当场。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47561,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日观画于成汝从宅","author":"邵宝","text":"龙眠猎骑云湖菊，笔底风神眼底稀。\n春日石鱼湖上雪，坐怜清赏几添衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47562,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱元抑春日过访用文内翰韵 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"旧隐归来已十年，风波回首几推迁。\n如闻野史新评在，勇退人今又姓钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":47563,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]